      "quote": "Additions must preserve training detections, increase semantic coverage, and satisfy the alarm and coverage constraints.",
      "assessment": "前一段刚定义 definite-output coverage，后一段引入未定义的 semantic coverage；读者可能把二者当作同一指标，也可能把 semantic quality 当成条件准确率或证据可信度。实际实现的 coverage 按语义组与训练修改记录去重，quality 是预登记的观测/语义偏好。",
